  "cleanText": "Solution home \n\t\tSelf Assessment \n\t\tSelf Assessment FAQs\n\n### Where to Update a Business Ceased Date in Self Assessment?\n\n\t\t\tPrint\n\n\tModified on: Thu, 27 Nov, 2025 at  2:47 PM\n\n\t\tTo update the cessation date of your business, please navigate to the Self Employment page >> Business Details >> Box 7 (Full form)/Box 6 (Short form): Date business ceased >> Update the details >> Save.\n\nNote: If you wish to provide any additional information, please refer to the Main Form >> Finishing your tax return >> Your tax advisor >> Box no 19: Any other information.\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo\n\nSend feedback\tSorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.",
  "bodyHtml": "\n\t<div class=\"breadcrumb\">\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions\"> Solution home </a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/9000115347\">Self Assessment </a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/folders/9000188547\">Self Assessment FAQs</a>\n\t</div>\n\t<b class=\"page-stamp page-stamp-article\">\n\t\t<b class=\"icon-page-article\"></b>\n\t</b>\n\n\t<h2 class=\"heading\">Where to Update a Business Ceased Date in Self Assessment?\n\t \t<a href=\"#\"\n            class=\"solution-print--icon print--remove\"\n \t\t\ttitle=\"Print this Article\"\n \t\t\tarial-role=\"link\"\n \t\t\tarial-label=\"Print this Article\"\n\t\t\tid=\"print-article\"\n \t\t>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"icon-print\"></span>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"text-print\">Print</span>\n \t\t</a>\n\t</h2>\n\t\n\t<p>Modified on: Thu, 27 Nov, 2025 at  2:47 PM</p>\n\t<hr />\n\t\n\n\t<article class=\"article-body\" id=\"article-body\" rel=\"image-enlarge\">\n\t\t<p dir=\"ltr\">To update the cessation date of your business, please navigate to the Self Employment page &gt;&gt; Business Details &gt;&gt; Box 7 (Full form)/Box 6 (Short form): Date business ceased &gt;&gt; Update the details &gt;&gt; Save.</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\">Note: If you wish to provide any additional information, please refer to the Main Form &gt;&gt; Finishing your tax return &gt;&gt; Your tax advisor &gt;&gt; Box no 19: Any other information.</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9240763511/original/S7m6ambe0YRSqN46iEmgBnecoWl3fkImZg.png?1764172102\" style=\"width: auto; max-width: 100%;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-id=\"9240763511\"></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9240764177/original/yMZs1mNQddLt_5Zz85VpyOAF1PZDjK3mLQ.png?1764172182\" style=\"width: auto; max-width: 100%;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-id=\"9240764177\"></p>\n\t</ar